WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.434
Card skimmers hid

00:00:01.246 --> 00:00:02.578
inside Black Friday

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:03.144
shopping

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:04.845
A skimming script

00:00:04.657 --> 00:00:05.564
was planted on

00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:06.095
the stores of

00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:06.673
Lascana

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.593
Samsonite

00:00:07.817 --> 00:00:09.102
American Tourister

00:00:09.362 --> 00:00:11.260
Revolve and FWRD

00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:11.802
in the week

00:00:11.626 --> 00:00:13.041
before Black Friday

00:00:13.558 --> 00:00:14.501
It stole card

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:15.798
numbers expiry dates

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:16.836
and security codes

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.732
then sent them

00:00:17.544 --> 00:00:18.239
out over a

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.619
WebRTC data channel

00:00:19.808 --> 00:00:20.963
outside the browser's

00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.331
usual request controls

00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:23.958
All five sites

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:24.902
removed the script

00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:26.234
by November twenty-fourth

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.154
or twenty-fifth

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.864
after researchers reported

00:00:28.676 --> 00:00:29.347
it to them

00:00:29.886 --> 00:00:30.900
Full story on

00:00:30.711 --> 00:00:31.607
the dashboard
